Workflow: Task Execution

Purpose:
  Define how AI executes tasks from .sdd/project/.
  Tasks are derived from approved docs and .sdd/project/ structure.

Inputs:
  - .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/*.sdd (task definitions)
  - .sdd/project/domains.sdd (domain structure)
  - .sdd/projects/{project_name}/stack/*.sdd (tech stack)
  - .sdd/skills/**/*.sdd (skill catalog)
  - .sdd/chains/*.sdd (execution chains)

Outputs:
  - Implemented code
  - Tests
  - Documentation
  - Updated task status

Steps:
   1. DISCOVER_TASKS:
      - Read .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/INDEX.sdd
      - Find tasks with status: ready
      - Respect dependency order

   2. RESOLVE_CONTEXT:
      - Load task definition
      - Load relevant skills
      - Load domain model
      - Load tech stack

   3. SELECT_CHAIN:
      - Determine chain type (default/feature/bugfix/hotfix)
      - Load chain definition
      - Execute stages in order

   4. EXECUTE_STAGES:
      - For each stage in chain:
        - Load stage skill
        - Execute stage logic
        - Validate output
        - Update state

   5. LOCAL_DOCKER_TEST:
      - Execute test hierarchy for task/subtask
      - SUBTASK level: run tests in builder Docker container
      - MODULE level: run module tests in test-runner Docker container
      - SYSTEM level: run system tests in test-runner Docker container
      - All test execution inside Docker ([R102])

   6. VALIDATE:
      - Run tests
      - Run linter
      - Verify against .sdd/project/
      - Include LOCAL_DOCKER_TEST results

   7. UPDATE_STATE:
      - Mark task complete
      - Update .sdd/project/state/
      - Notify human

Human Gates:
  - Plan review (before implementation)
  - Code review (after implementation)
  - Deployment approval (before production)

Rules:
   [TE1] Tasks MUST be executed in dependency order.
   [TE2] Each task MUST validate before proceeding.
   [TE3] Human MUST approve before production deployment.
   [TE4] All changes MUST be tracked in .sdd/project/state/.
   [TE5] Failed tasks MUST trigger recovery workflow.
   [TE6] Local Docker test execution MUST pass before validation ([R102]).

State: +
